# The CEF the natives packages carry: CEF's official "minimal" distribution, as published on
# cef-builds.spotifycdn.com, pinned by version and SHA-1 (the CDN's own index lists both).
# The engine's API version is 14600 (CEF 146), which every CEF from 146 to this one offers
# (spike L0, question 2), so a newer CEF here needs no engine change.
